:: Chronicler's Temple
<<set $player.location="Chronicler's Temple">>\

You open the wooden door and set foot inside the temple. It's no surprise that such an important building would stand in the heart of Ordson's Industrial District. Ordson has always valued science and progress, with knowledge forming an integral part of its mission.

Some might say that the Chronicler Aeyenlo was one of the gods most responsible for shaping Ordson into what it is today. The statue of the Scholar-God towers over you, reminding you that you're only a small piece in the course of history.

[[Pray|Chronicler's Temple - Pray]]

[[Leave|Industrial District]]

:: Chronicler's Temple - Pray
You bow your head in front of the statue and say a prayer to Aeyenlo.

[[Continue Praying|Chronicler's Temple - Pray]]
